1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,520
Mine.

2
00:00:48,870 --> 00:00:50,020
Are we looking a bit pathetic?

3
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:50,945
I'm not looking like this.

4
00:00:50,945 --> 00:00:54,170
I'm not looking, Mom.

5
00:00:54,670 --> 00:00:55,570
Amitabha.

6
00:00:58,260 --> 00:00:59,385
I dare not open my eyes

7
00:00:59,385 --> 00:01:00,960
Hope it's just my imagination

8
00:01:02,710 --> 00:01:03,760
Use the Light-Up Card.

9
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:06,410
12345

10
00:01:06,910 --> 00:01:07,460
It's fine.

11
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:08,760
Not scared at all.

12
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:09,210
It's fine.

13
00:01:16,710 --> 00:01:17,160
Let me do it.

14
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:19,670
Who spoils you? Everyone spoils me.

15
00:01:20,420 --> 00:01:21,370
Everyone has to spoil me

16
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:22,870
Ding Pudding

17
00:01:23,370 --> 00:01:24,470
I love you so much!

18
00:01:26,870 --> 00:01:27,445
Act cute.

19
00:01:27,445 --> 00:01:28,120
Act cute, then.

20
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:29,270
Beg me.

21
00:01:29,270 --> 00:01:30,170
Beg your bro.

22
00:01:32,070 --> 00:01:32,970
What the heck?

23
00:01:34,460 --> 00:01:36,010
Call me bro.

24
00:01:36,810 --> 00:01:39,110
Bro can't take it anymore

25
00:01:39,410 --> 00:01:40,910
So, are you treating me or not?

26
00:01:40,910 --> 00:01:41,660
What's mine is yours,

27
00:01:41,660 --> 00:01:42,510
and what's yours is still mine.

28
00:01:42,510 --> 00:01:43,910
And a new big bro.

29
00:01:44,660 --> 00:01:45,010
Right.

30
00:01:45,010 --> 00:01:45,660
Second bro.

31
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:48,160
Second bro, you're the killer.

32
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:49,760
I was raised on bragging.

33
00:01:49,810 --> 00:01:51,060
Then I'll Shoot down you.

34
00:01:51,710 --> 00:01:52,360
Baby Ding

35
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:54,710
Didn't you buy something with your car keys?

36
00:01:57,200 --> 00:02:05,350
Baby Ding is being framed!

37
00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:07,400
Sis.

38
00:02:09,550 --> 00:02:10,175
Are you mad?

39
00:02:10,175 --> 00:02:10,450
You.

40
00:02:11,700 --> 00:02:13,075
Don't ask so many whys.

41
00:02:13,075 --> 00:02:14,000
Why are there so many whys?

42
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:14,400
Why?

43
00:02:14,460 --> 00:02:14,960
Why?

44
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:15,910
Whose dad am I?

45
00:02:16,060 --> 00:02:17,660
Or am I the dad of all four of you?

46
00:02:18,310 --> 00:02:19,310
Call me, call me.

47
00:02:19,310 --> 00:02:20,185
Hurry up and call me.

48
00:02:20,185 --> 00:02:21,910
Ding Ning is awesome.

49
00:02:22,010 --> 00:02:23,835
Truly awesome.

50
00:02:23,835 --> 00:02:24,410
Hey.

51
00:02:24,410 --> 00:02:25,910
Give it to little bro.

52
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:26,660
Let little bro do it.

53
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:31,760
Let's go.

54
00:02:39,550 --> 00:02:40,950
Absolute king.

55
00:02:42,900 --> 00:02:43,450
Awesome.

56
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:45,888
Little bro is amazing.

57
00:02:45,888 --> 00:02:48,400
The undisputed king of games.

58
00:02:49,650 --> 00:02:51,200
Can this photo be opened?

59
00:02:51,420 --> 00:02:52,945
Could there be something inside?

60
00:02:52,945 --> 00:02:54,608
The flowers from the wreath you made.

61
00:02:54,608 --> 00:02:55,570
Red flowers.

62
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:56,420
Let me tell you,

63
00:02:56,420 --> 00:02:57,970
I think the key clue is here.

64
00:02:57,970 --> 00:03:00,695
I want to see if there's a complete sword inside.

65
00:03:00,695 --> 00:03:04,070
I feel we're very, very close to the key evidence today.

66
00:03:04,170 --> 00:03:06,470
You need to take the first spot before he does.

67
00:03:06,470 --> 00:03:07,895
Whether we vote correctly or not, we can still win.

68
00:03:07,895 --> 00:03:09,120
Then if I were the killer,

69
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:11,570
wouldn't I actively look for my alibi?

70
00:03:12,050 --> 00:03:12,800
Right? Right, right.

71
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,575
But actually, I was just there.

72
00:03:14,575 --> 00:03:17,725
This is actually enough to make him less of a suspect.

73
00:03:17,725 --> 00:03:18,850
We open this door,

74
00:03:19,050 --> 00:03:20,575
lure them over like this,

75
00:03:20,575 --> 00:03:23,850
then just block and lock this door, right?

76
00:03:23,950 --> 00:03:25,550
Is this that dead body?

77
00:03:25,550 --> 00:03:29,700
Because this head looks electrocuted, like a charred, black beluga.

78
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:31,350
It's a very smart...

79
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:32,165
creature.

80
00:03:32,165 --> 00:03:32,965
Creature, yes.

81
00:03:32,965 --> 00:03:34,990
I think it could figure out a lot of things.

82
00:03:34,990 --> 00:03:36,790
A room just has anti-collision strips,

83
00:03:36,790 --> 00:03:37,290
right?

84
00:03:37,290 --> 00:03:38,190
That doesn't prove anything.

85
00:03:38,190 --> 00:03:38,490
Actually,

86
00:03:38,490 --> 00:03:39,415
As long as I'm out in the open,

87
00:03:39,415 --> 00:03:40,690
I'll mess up all the games.

88
00:03:41,140 --> 00:03:42,840
You won't have a single chance.

89
00:03:42,890 --> 00:03:44,440
Just this... this one.
